hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1090","(121) Jiska aman jayez hai aur dastay ka lashkar ki taraf lautne ka bab: 1128 - Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ahmad ibn Khalid al-Wahbi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Amr ibn Shuayb se, unke walid se, unke dada Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) Fath wale saal Makkah mein dakhil hue to hum mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) khutba dene ke liye khade hue aur farmaya: Ae logon, jahiliyyat mein jo bhi hilf tha to Islam ne use mazbooti mein hi badhaya hai, aur Islam mein koi hilf nahin, aur Musalman unke siwa sab ke muqable mein ek haath hain, unka adna shakhs unki taraf se aman dega, aur unka door wala unki taraf lautayega, aur unke dastay unke peeche rehne walon ki taraf lauteinge, aur koi momin kafir ke badle qatl nahin kiya jayega, kafir ki diyat momin ki diyat ka aadha hai, na jalab hai aur na janab, aur unke sadaqat unke gharon ke siwa kahin nahin liye jayenge."
